ership, disclaimers, limitations of liability, indemnity, and payment obligations already incurred.`,3,null),t(`h2`,null,{id:`governing-law`,class:`doc-h2`},`15. Governing law`,3,null),t(`p`,null,{class:`doc-p`},`These Terms are governed by the laws applicable where Twyne's operator is based, without regard to conflict-of-law rules, except where applicable consumer-protection law requires otherwise.`,3,null),t(`h2`,null,{id:`changes`,class:`doc-h2`},`16. Changes`,3,null),t(`p`,null,{class:`doc-p`},`We may update these Terms from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by updating the "last updated" date above. Continued use of the Service after changes take effect constitutes acceptance.`,3,null),t(`h2`,null,{id:`contact`,class:`doc-h2`},`17. Contact`,3,null),t(`p`,null,{class:`doc-p`},[`Questions about these Terms can be sent to`,` `,t(`a`,null,{href:`mailto:support@twyne.love`},`support@twyne.love`,3,null),`.`],3,null)],3,`YE_0`));var a=n(i),o={title:`Terms of Service · Twyne`,meta:[{name:`description`,content:`Twyne's Terms of Service: your account, your content, AI and bring-your-own-key usage, publishing, disclaimers, and liability.`}]};export{a as default,o as head};
