ter)`}},`Section VII`,3,null),n(`h2`,null,{class:`doc-h2`},`Privacy & Your Data`,3,null),n(`p`,null,{class:`doc-lead`},`Your manuscript is yours. We intend to keep it that way.`,3,null),n(`p`,null,{class:`doc-p`},[n(`strong`,null,null,`API keys:`,3,null),` Saved in your browser’s IndexedDB. Remote BYOK requests pass through Twyne’s server relay, which forwards your key and request to the selected provider. Local model endpoints stay direct.`],3,null),n(`p`,null,{class:`doc-p`},[n(`strong`,null,null,`Drafts and folios:`,3,null),` Saved locally in your browser via IndexedDB. If you sign in, they sync to your own Convex account for cross-device access. They are not shared, sold, or used to train models.`],3,null),n(`p`,null,{class:`doc-p`},[n(`strong`,null,null,`AI calls:`,3,null),` When you BYOK, your draft text goes to the provider you chose, through the relay for remote endpoints. Hosted calls go through Convex and Not Organic. Provider processing and content-logging consent are managed in Not Organic.`],3,null),n(`p`,null,{class:`doc-p`},[n(`strong`,null,null,`Published pieces:`,3,null),` Only what you explicitly publish becomes public. Everything else stays private to your account.`],3,null)],3,null),n(`section`,null,{id:`folios`,class:`doc-section`},[n(`p`,null,{class:`text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] mb-2`,style:{fontFamily:`var(--font-typewriter)`}},`Section VIII`,3,null),n(`h2`,null,{class:`doc-h2`},`Folios, Export & Share`,3,null),n(`p`,null,{class:`doc-lead`},`One project. Many drafts. Each lives in its own folio.`,3,null),n(`p`,null,{class:`doc-p`},`Folios are separate documents within the same project. You might have a main draft, a scratch notes folio, and an outline. Switch between them from the left drawer. Each folio keeps its own word count, update time, and (optionally) its own layout settings.`,3,null),n(`p`,null,{class:`doc-p`},[n(`strong`,null,null,`Export`,3,null),` your folio as Markdown, standalone HTML, p